# Optional: high-quality logo sources for the stock sidebar/header.
# Without these the app falls through to free public services
# (Unavatar → DuckDuckGo → Google Favicons → 2-letter monogram).

# Logo.dev — sharp brand logos in 256–512px.
#   Sign up: https://logo.dev (free tier 10,000 requests/month)
#   Token format: "pub_..." (publishable key, safe to ship in browser)
# VITE_LOGODEV_TOKEN=pub_...

# Brandfetch — best quality, includes light/dark variants.
#   Sign up: https://brandfetch.com (free tier)
#   Client ID format: alphanumeric ID (browser-safe)
# VITE_BRANDFETCH_ID=...

# To use: copy this file to web/.env.local (which is gitignored), uncomment
# the variable(s) you want and paste your token. Restart `npm run web`.
